{
  "dom_id": "step-e3903",
  "name": "Example: Identifying the Horizontal Stretch of a Transformed Secant or Cosecant Curve",
  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14257592/assets/b1519b3f69264490089e957a33441cd0e8c03bc762ec1609a71bb480e164b28e.png)\n\nThe graph above shows a section of the function $y=\\csc{\\left(Bx-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)},$ where $B$ is a constant. What is the value of $B?$",
  "worked_solution": "The period of the function is\n\n$$\nT =  \\frac{27\\pi}{4} -\\frac{3\\pi}{4} = \\frac{24\\pi}{4} = 6\\pi.\n$$\n\nThe formula for the period of the function $y=A\\csc(Bx + C) + D$ is given by \n\n$$\nT = \\dfrac{2\\pi}{B}.\n$$\n\nApplying the formula for $T$ gives\n\n$$\n6\\pi = \\dfrac{2\\pi}{B} \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad B = \\dfrac{2\\pi}{6\\pi} = \\dfrac 1 3.\n$$\n\nSo $B=\\dfrac 1 3,$ and therefore, the equation of the function is\n\n$$\ny=\\csc\\left(\\dfrac x 3-\\dfrac\\pi 4\\right).\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e3903\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Identifying the Horizontal Stretch of a Transformed Secant or Cosecant Curve</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e3903\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .